From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 03:26:27 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] test(03-26): add failing tests for profile-aware query
 embedding

- Off switch keeps the legacy embedder and legacy RPCs
- Non-legacy profile embeds through the provider at the profile dims
- Wrong length, same-dims model swap and startup mismatch give status error
- Unreadable registry gives status error, never the legacy embedder
- MISMATCH line is written once per distinct cause
- Neutral stubs for the new query-embedding module and the mismatch error class

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
